            <p style="font-size:13px;color:#333"><b>Subject:</b> Request for Testing of Solar Net Meter under PM Surya Ghar: Muft Bijli Yojana</p>
            <p style="font-size:13px;color:#333"><b>Reference:</b> Letter No. 149 dated 22/05/2025 regarding testing of solar meters under PM Surya Ghar Yojana.</p>
            <p style="font-size:13px;color:#333">Sir,<br/>With reference to the subject cited above, we are submitting the following solar net ${meterWord} for testing. Kindly arrange testing at the earliest and grant your approval so that further installation and commissioning process may be completed.</p>
            <table style="border-collapse:collapse;width:100%;margin:16px 0">
              <thead>
                <tr style="background:#fef0e6">
                  <th style="padding:8px;border:1px solid #e5c9a8;font-size:12px;text-align:left">Sl.</th>
                  <th style="padding:8px;border:1px solid #e5c9a8;font-size:12px;text-align:left">Customer Name</th>
