                </tr>
              </thead>
              <tbody>${itemRowsHtml}</tbody>
            </table>
            <p style="font-size:13px;color:#333">Therefore, we kindly request you to <b>test the above-mentioned ${meterWord} at the earliest and grant your approval</b> so that the project may proceed further. The complete signed letter is attached as PDF for your records.</p>
