          </div>
          <div style="background:#e8650a;padding:12px 26px;text-align:center">
            <p style="color:#fff;margin:0;font-size:11px">Divyanshi Digital Services Pvt. Ltd. | 9801005212, 8709127232 | chandrakant@divyanshisolar.in | www.divyanshisolar.in</p>
